--- Fires after vanilla input polling when a gamepad axis or slider changes. Includes joysticks enumerated by vanilla DirectInput and requires the game to initialize those devices. This observes raw state changes, including state resets when acquisition fails. It does not block game input.
--- @class gamepadAxisEventData
--- @field claim boolean If set to `true`, any lower-priority event callbacks will be skipped. Returning `false` will set this to `true`.
--- @field axis tes3.gamepadAxis *Read-only*. The zero-based axis ID. Compare against tes3.gamepadAxis constants.
--- @field gamepad integer *Read-only*. The zero-based gamepad ID.
--- @field previousValue integer *Read-only*. The value from the preceding input poll, in the same units as value.
--- @field value integer *Read-only*. Raw absolute device-dependent axis value. No additional normalization or dead zone is applied.
